reply.body:
I think the only delete attempt need to happen in `finally` block (wrapped into its own `try`).

```
try {
 createIndex;
 createTestDocuments;
 assert;
} finally {
  try { delete; }
}
```

This way it will not swallow original exception (from assert) in case index deletion fails.

